					"nextDialogs": [
						400741207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741207,
					"content": "真令人意外，宮廷大法師梅姬斯圖斯卿也有混得很差的階段呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741208,
					"content": "被人誤解的生活，一定很難熬…妳能釋懷真是太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楓原萬葉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741209,
					"content": "其實，真有人因為受不了這些，忍痛放棄了占星術。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741210,
					"content": "但我是天才嘛，肯定能做到別人做不到的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741211,
					"content": "在這麼宏偉漂亮的地方說這種話，格外有魄力哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741212,
						400741213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400741212,
					"content": "莫娜真厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400741214,
					"content": "很好很好，再多誇一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400741215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
